docs {
  ## Create Job Order — Proposal Not Approved

  Tests that only approved proposals can create orders.
  Replace `PENDING_PROPOSAL_UUID` with a non-approved proposal.

  Expected: 400 Bad Request — "Proposal is not approved"
}
